WEBVTT

00:20:27.871 --> 00:20:30.538
literally millions of people
are all struggling with

00:20:30.538 --> 00:20:35.288
a massive upheaval all at once and one
that inherently lasts a long time.

00:20:36.371 --> 00:20:39.913
Bad economic conditions make everything
in our lives feel unstable

00:20:40.079 --> 00:20:44.704
and out of our control. Millions of jobs
have been lost through the pandemic

00:20:44.913 --> 00:20:46.621
and millions more are at risk.

00:20:47.246 --> 00:20:50.163
People of color, especially
those in lower paid jobs

00:20:50.163 --> 00:20:52.871
and without college degrees,
have suffered the most.

00:20:53.496 --> 00:20:56.579
Research shows that job loss doesn't
just create financial strain.

00:20:56.913 --> 00:20:59.038
It also increases the risk of depression,

00:20:59.038 --> 00:21:03.204
anxiety and marital problems and
undermines our sense of control